  "2026-07-27T10:05:42.744Z","harness:codex","Evidence: implementation is complete; pnpm lint passed with zero jscpd clones, static/docstring/SDK compatibility gates passed, 375 files and 6,404 tests passed at 100/100/100/100 coverage, and an unrelated packed consumer resolved its local executable then passed install/doctor/create/list plus npx and bunx version smoke tests."
